%% ============ SD1 · 启动与导航装配 ============
sequenceDiagram
    participant M as main()
    participant H as Hive
    participant S as TaskStore
    participant R as ReminderService
    participant P as PromptLoader
    participant App as MyApp/TabShell
    M->>H: initFlutter + registerAdapter(TaskAdapter)
    M->>S: init()
    M->>R: init/scheduleAll/markMissedIfNeeded
    M->>P: loadAll()  %% 读 assets/prompts/*.yaml → PromptDef（无审批覆盖）
    M->>App: runApp(ChangeNotifierProvider(S), Provider(R), ...)
    Note over App: SplashScreen「开始规划」→ pushReplacement(TabShell)
    App->>App: IndexedStack[ TasksTab, NotebookTab ]

%% ============ SD2 · 语音录入 → 提示词取用 → LLM / 本地解析 ============
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant T as TasksTab(SpeedDial) / NotebookTab(FAB)
    participant V as VoiceInputScreen / NotebookDetail
    participant PD as PromptDef(<module>_voice[/<sub_function>])
    participant AS as AliyunAsrService
    participant SS as AliyunScheduleService / NotebookVoiceService
    participant NL as NlpParser(本地兜底)
    participant CD as ConflictDetector
    participant S as TaskStore / NotebookStore
    U->>T: 点「语音添加」
    T->>V: push(录入页)
    U->>V: 点麦克风说话
    V->>AS: transcribe()
    AS-->>V: transcript
    V->>SS: parse(transcript, system=PD.prompt)   %% 设计阶段已批准，直接取用
    SS-->>V: 结构化草稿（任务 / NotebookItem）
    opt 任务模块
        loop 每个候选
            V->>CD: detect(candidate, existing)
            CD-->>V: ConflictResult → applyDecision
        end
    end
    V-->>U: preview
    U->>V: 确认添加
    V->>S: addWithConflictCheck / addItem
    S-->>V: 完成 → pop
    Note over V,S: 学习子功能：courseId 由 App 在「课程子页面」注入，记录直接挂该课程（LLM 不出课程名）
